import type { TacticalMapData } from '../../src/data/tactical/TacticalSchemas'; import { TacticalMap } from '../../src/data/tactical/TacticalMap'; import type { BattleDefinition, CombatData, UnitBattleState } from '../../src/combat/CombatTypes'; import { templateId, unitId, weaponId } from '../../src/combat/CombatTypes'; import { createUnit } from '../../src/combat/UnitModel'; import { createMapFixture } from './mapFixture';
export function combatData(): CombatData { return { version: 1, templates: [{ id: templateId('fighter'), displayName: 'Fighter', jobId: 'test', level: 1, stats: { maxHp: 40, maxMp: 5, speed: 10, move: 4, jump: 1, physicalAttack: 14, physicalDefense: 8, magicAttack: 4, magicDefense: 5, accuracy: 10, evasion: 5, criticalChance: 5 }, weaponId: weaponId('sword'), abilities: [], aiProfile: 'aggressiveMelee' }, { id: templateId('fast'), displayName: 'Fast', jobId: 'test', level: 1, stats: { maxHp: 30, maxMp: 5, speed: 20, move: 4, jump: 1, physicalAttack: 10, physicalDefense: 6, magicAttack: 4, magicDefense: 5, accuracy: 10, evasion: 5, criticalChance: 5 }, weaponId: weaponId('bow'), abilities: [], aiProfile: 'cautiousRanged' }], weapons: [{ id: weaponId('sword'), name: 'Sword', category: 'sword', power: 8, minRange: 1, maxRange: 1, maxElevationDelta: 1, accuracyModifier: 5, criticalModifier: 0, permitsCounter: true }, { id: weaponId('bow'), name: 'Bow', category: 'bow', power: 6, minRange: 2, maxRange: 4, maxElevationDelta: 2, accuracyModifier: 0, criticalModifier: 0, permitsCounter: true }], abilities: [], aiProfiles: [{ id: 'aggressiveMelee', killWeight: 1000, damageWeight: 8, hitWeight: 2, rearWeight: 60, sideWeight: 20, hazardPenalty: 200, maxDestinations: 32, maxTargets: 8, maxOperations: 128 }, { id: 'cautiousRanged', killWeight: 1000, damageWeight: 7, hitWeight: 3, rearWeight: 30, sideWeight: 15, hazardPenalty: 300, maxDestinations: 32, maxTargets: 8, maxOperations: 128 }, { id: 'defensive', killWeight: 800, damageWeight: 5, hitWeight: 2, rearWeight: 10, sideWeight: 5, hazardPenalty: 400, maxDestinations: 16, maxTargets: 8, maxOperations: 64 }], statuses: [{ id: 'guard', stackPolicy: 'refresh', speedMultiplier: 1, damageMultiplier: .6, poisonDamage: 0 }, { id: 'haste', stackPolicy: 'refresh', speedMultiplier: 1.5, damageMultiplier: 1, poisonDamage: 0 }, { id: 'slow', stackPolicy: 'refresh', speedMultiplier: .5, damageMultiplier: 1, poisonDamage: 0 }, { id: 'poison', stackPolicy: 'refresh', speedMultiplier: 1, damageMultiplier: 1, poisonDamage: 4 }] }; }
export function battleDefinition(): BattleDefinition { return { version: 1, id: 'test', mapId: 'test-map', seed: 123, units: [{ id: unitId('ally'), templateId: templateId('fighter'), team: 'allies', position: { x: 0, y: 0 }, facing: 'east', controllable: true, spawnOrder: 0 }, { id: unitId('enemy'), templateId: templateId('fighter'), team: 'enemies', position: { x: 2, y: 0 }, facing: 'west', controllable: false, spawnOrder: 1 }], objectives: [{ id: 'win', type: 'defeatAllEnemies', description: 'Win' }, { id: 'survive', type: 'keepAllyAlive', description: 'Survive' }] }; }
export function tacticalMap(overrides: Partial<TacticalMapData> = {}): TacticalMap { return new TacticalMap(createMapFixture(overrides)); }
export function units(): [UnitBattleState, UnitBattleState] { const data = combatData(); const definition = battleDefinition(); return [createUnit(data.templates[0]!, definition.units[0]!), createUnit(data.templates[0]!, definition.units[1]!)]; }
